common_passwords.txt: the 10,000 most common passwords, one per line, unmodified. Read by
app/auth/passwords.py (compared case-insensitively); never fetched at runtime.

Source: SecLists, Passwords/Common-Credentials/10k-most-common.txt
  https://github.com/danielmiessler/SecLists
  Downloaded 2026-11-16 from the master branch, where the file last changed in commit
  913b327317496d062bcc7cace524aaad8a693be2.
